'''Ahzidal''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priest]] entombed within [[Skyrim:Kolbjorn Barrow|Kolbjorn Barrow]] in [[Skyrim:Solstheim|Solstheim]]. He carries an [[Skyrim:Ahzidal (item)|eponymous mask]].

He specializes in fire-based magic, able to cast: [[Skyrim:Greater Ward|Greater Ward]], [[Skyrim:Ebonyflesh|Ebonyflesh]], [[Skyrim:Revenant|Revenant]], [[Skyrim:Raise Zombie|Raise Zombie]], [[Skyrim:Flame Cloak|Flame Cloak]], and Fire Stream, a unique spell similar to the [[Skyrim:Fire Breath|Fire Breath]] shout. His heavy armor set includes [[Skyrim:Ahzidal's Armor of Retribution|Ahzidal's Armor of Retribution]], [[Skyrim:Ahzidal's Boots of Waterwalking|Ahzidal's Boots of Waterwalking]], [[Skyrim:Ahzidal's Gauntlets of Warding|Ahzidal's Gauntlets of Warding]], [[Skyrim:Ahzidal's Helm of Vision|Ahzidal's Helm of Vision]], and his mask.

For more information, see the [[Lore:Ahzidal|lore page]].

